        "original_id": "585b51d2-653a-5eb7-8ecf-5f70aca244ed",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- Products: The Original Soundtrack, \"I'm Not in Love\", \"Life Is a Minestrone\", Relayted\n- People: Eric Stewart, Graham Gouldman\n- Organizations: 10cc\n- Concepts: singles, songwriting inspiration, tempo\n\nFacts:\n- The Original Soundtrack includes the singles \"Life Is a Minestrone\" and \"I'm Not in Love\".\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" is the most popular song by 10cc.\n- \"I'm Not in Love\" is a song by the English group 10cc.\n- Eric Stewart and Graham Gouldman, members of 10cc, wrote \"I'm Not in Love\".\n- Relayted was inspired by 10cc's \"I'm Not in Love\".\n- Every song on Relayted was recorded at 69 BPM.",
